Lane complete. Two commits landed:

1. `d043513` - **fix(web): D17 parity fixes for Home/About (WO-INF-061 u10)** — 3 files changed, 76 insertions, 62 deletions
2. `6e7b43b` - **chore: lane report for web-c-build-d17-fix1**

**What was fixed:**

| Item | Brief problem | Root cause | Fix |
|------|-------------|-----------|-----|
| 1 | Hero DO-ART-916 documents don't render | `.stage` container had no CSS rule; literal `"stage"` class | Added `.a916 .stage` rule to module; changed to `d17.stage` |
| 2 | DO-ART-917 KPI numbers small, labels run together | `.n`, `.l`, `.d` literal classes don't match scoped module selectors | Changed all to `d17.n`, `d17.l`, `d17.d` |
| 3 | DO-ART-919a/b figures dark-on-dark | `.factFig`/`.factFigSub` rules missing from module entirely | Added amber number and subtitle rules |
| 4 | DO-ART-719 stray unstyled text | `.docket` defined in `homepage.css` which About page doesn't import | Added `.docket`/`.issued` to D17 module |
| 5-7 | Large sizes, mobile stacking | All downstream of class name mismatches | Fixed by the above |

**Root cause across all items:** CSS modules scope class names, but the JSX used literal strings (`className="n"`) instead of module references (`className={d17.n}`). This affected ~30+ class references across DO-ART-916, 917, 918, 831, and 719.
